# AI-authored one-shot dev_ops scripts (per Recto Hard Rule #10 they
# self-delete after success; the .gitignore is belt-and-suspenders so
# `git add -A` never stages a transient one-shot into a real commit).
# The gscript_*.ps1 / gscript.ps1 rules went with the family, 2026-08-16 —
# pushes ride the compiled `thrice` tool, which leaves no per-sprint artifact.
faxscript_*.ps1
dscript_*.ps1
tscript_*.ps1
vscript_*.ps1
lscript_*.ps1
bscript_*.ps1
xscript_*.ps1
